{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-01/1063015/block/singleImage/3263180/df/01KENFNPB9V3PHM451E7H9DA5V.JPG?updatedAt=1794300299\"/><figcaption>東區醫院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>西灣河發生工業意外。 今日（10日）下午2時38分，一名63歲男工於西灣河太康街1號使用電動工具期間，疑意外割傷手掌流血，傷口長約10厘米。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，男工清醒由救護車送往東區醫院治理，由一名男工友陪同送院。警方正在調查事件。消息指，該工具疑為電鋸。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.602638+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:44:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:41.714852+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:14.082765+00:00","content_hash":"fb788099706308cf820cb59c71b28b7c62d8fbbd3b310fd1cdd26c64e8114866","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.602638+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}